# Architecture Rules

Start every session: [planning/README.md](../planning/README.md) → [docs/current.md](../docs/current.md).

- Follow [docs/constitution.md](../docs/constitution.md) and [docs/architecture/invariants.md](../docs/architecture/invariants.md)
- Use terms from [docs/glossary.md](../docs/glossary.md) only
- Respect forbidden packages in docs/current.md
- Never mix doc layers (law / architecture / contract / spec / task / planning)
- New markdown docs: copy from [docs/templates/](../docs/templates/)
- Code-first: docs reflect implemented state, not planned state
- No hardcoded agent types (Planner/Coder/etc.) in internal/ core packages
